# The Elite Four of Unova (Shauntal, Grimsley, Marshal and Caitlin): a driving trumpet line in E minor over stabbing brass, a
# running piano, octave bass and a pounding kit, with the brass giving way to an alarm while a Pokémon of the player's is in the
# red. Original composition for this game (plan 22 · U9, part c).
